      sites-cli check URL [--width 1440] [--screenshot PATH] [--ignore SUBSTR]

    Every tool subcommand also takes --json FILE (or --json -) to supply the
    whole arguments object; explicit flags override individual keys.

    --expected defaults to the branch head token this CLI last saw for that
    slug+branch (#{STATE_PATH}), written after every describe/read/save/
